@startuml 16-state-modal-store
title Modal Yönetimi - useModal (zustand) Durum Diyagramı

state "Kapalı" as Closed
Closed : type = null
Closed : isOpen = false

state "Açık" as Open {
  state "createServer" as cs
  state "editServer" as es
  state "deleteServer" as ds
  state "leaveServer" as ls
  state "invite" as inv
  state "members" as mem
  state "createChannel" as cc
  state "editChannel" as ec
  state "deleteChannel" as dc
  state "messageFile" as mf
  state "deleteMessage" as dm
  state "helpModal" as hm
}
Open : isOpen = true
Open : data = { server?, channel?, channelType?,\n apiUrl?, query?, helpSectionModalInfo? }

[*] --> Closed
Closed --> Open : onOpen(type, data)
Open --> Open : onOpen(type, data)\n(ör. invite → yeni kod,\nmembers → güncel liste)
Open --> Closed : onClose()\n(veya işlem başarılı)

note right of Open
  Her modal bileşeni şunu kontrol eder:
  isModalOpen = isOpen && type === "<kendi tipi>"
  ModalProvider tüm modalları tek seferde mount eder.
end note
@enduml
